<InfoPage title="Contact" kicker="Corrections and rights" description="How to contact the GirlfriendGPT editorial site about factual corrections, privacy, source updates, or rights concerns."><h2>Editorial requests</h2><p>Include the affected URL, exact statement or asset, reason for the request, and a primary source supporting the correction.</p><h2>Do not send sensitive material</h2><p>We do not need account credentials, private companion chats, identification documents, voice recordings, or intimate images to review a correction.</p><h2>Contact address</h2><p><a href="mailto:support@girlfriendgpt.fun">support@girlfriendgpt.fun</a> is the intended editorial address, but mailbox delivery has not yet been configured. Do not rely on it for urgent requests or send private material until receipt is confirmed.</p></InfoPage>
